{'symbol': 'DGX', 'date': '2022-11-14 17:45:00', 'title': 'QUEST DIAGNOSTICS DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': "SECAUCUS, N.J. , NOV. 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- QUEST DIAGNOSTICS\xa0(NYSE: DGX), THE WORLD'S LEADING PROVIDER OF DIAGNOSTIC INFORMATION SERVICES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF\xa0$0.66\xa0PER SHARE, PAYABLE\xa0ON\xa0FEBRUARY 1, 2023\xa0TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD OF\xa0QUEST DIAGNOSTICS COMMON STOCK ON\xa0JANUARY 18, 2023."}